==Scottish Premiership==
{{Main|2020–21 Scottish Premiership}}
The [[2020–21 Scottish Premiership|Scottish Premiership]] fixture list was announced on 6 July 2020. Celtic began their title defence against [[Hamilton Academical F.C.|Hamilton Academical]] at [[Celtic Park]].<ref>{{cite web | url=http://www.celticfc.com/news/18292 | title=Celtic kick off title defence with home game against Hamilton Accies | publisher=Celtic FC | date=6 July 2020 | access-date=6 July 2020}}</ref>

