==Scottish Cup==
{{Main|2020–21 Scottish Cup}}
On 23 March, it was determined that Celtic would face [[Falkirk F.C.|Falkirk]] at [[Celtic Park]] in the third round of the [[2020–21 Scottish Cup]].<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2021/january/Celtic-face-Arbroath-or-Falkirk-in-the-Scottish-Cup/ | title=Celtic face Arbroath or Falkirk in the Scottish Cup | publisher=Celtic FC | date=10 January 2021 | access-date=10 January 2021}}</ref> On 4 April, it was determined that Celtic would face [[Rangers F.C.|Rangers]] at [[Ibrox Stadium]] in the fourth round.<ref>{{cite web | url=https://www.celticfc.com/news/2021/april/Celtic-face-away-tie-as-Scottish-Cup-defence-continues/ | title=Celtic face away tie as Scottish Cup defence continues | publisher=Celtic FC | date=4 April 2021 | access-date=4 April 2021}}</ref>

