==UEFA Europa League==
{{Main|2020–21 UEFA Europa League}}
Celtic entered the Europa League at the third qualifying round.

===Third qualifying round===
On 18 September, it was determined that Celtic would face [[Riga FC|Riga]] ([[Latvia]]) in the third qualifying round of the [[2020–21 UEFA Europa League|UEFA Europa League]].<ref>{{cite web | url=http://www.celticfc.com/news/18555 | title=Manager reacts to Europa League draw and looks ahead to Latvia | publisher=Celtic FC | date=18 September 2020 | access-date=18 September 2020}}</ref>

