===Group stage===
On 2 October, the draw for the [[2020–21 UEFA Europa League#Group stage|2020–21 UEFA Europa League group stage]] was made. Celtic were drawn in [[2020–21 UEFA Europa League#Group H|Group H]] along with [[AC Sparta Prague|Sparta Prague]] (Pot 2), [[A.C. Milan|Milan]] (Pot 3) and [[Lille OSC|Lille]] (Pot 4).<ref>{{cite web | url=http://www.celticfc.com/news/18604 | title=Celtic's UEFA Europa League Group H opponents | publisher=Celtic FC | date=2 October 2020 | access-date=2 October 2020}}</ref>

