*'''Home:''' The home kit features the club's traditional green and white hoops, with a yellow trim. White shorts and hooped white socks complete the look.<ref>{{cite web | url=http://www.celticfc.com/news/18307 | title=adidas x Celtic FC unveil the home kit. Pre-order now | publisher=Celtic FC | date=10 July 2020 | access-date=11 July 2020}}</ref>
*'''Away:''' The away kit features a mint green shirt, with a dark green trim. The shirt is accompanied by dark green shorts and hooped socks.<ref>{{cite web | url=http://www.celticfc.com/news/18375 | title=adidas x Celtic FC unveil the away kit. Pre-order now | publisher=Celtic FC | date=31 July 2020 | access-date=31 July 2020}}</ref>
*'''Third:''' The third kit features a midnight black shirt, with a mint green embroidered four-leaf clover. The shirt is accompanied by black shorts and socks.<ref>{{cite web | url=http://www.celticfc.com/news/18463 | title=2020/21 adidas kit collection is complete. The third kit is revealed | publisher=Celtic FC | date=24 August 2020 | access-date=24 August 2020}}</ref>

